msgid "Comment Reply Email Notification"
msgstr "评论回复电邮通知"

#. Description of the plugin
#: cren_plugin.php
msgid "Sends an email notification to the comment author when someone replies to his comment."
msgstr "当有人对评论者的评论进行回复时，向其发送电子邮件通知。"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:171
#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:177
#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:249
#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:251
msgid "New reply to your comment"
msgstr "您的评论有了新的回复"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:370
msgid "Your subscription for this comment has been cancelled."
msgstr "您对该评论的订阅已被取消。"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:402
#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:430
msgid "Notify me via e-mail if anyone answers my comment."
msgstr "如果有人回复我的评论，请通过电子邮件通知我。"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:512
msgid "I consent to %s collecting and storing the data I submit in this form."
msgstr "我同意%s收集和储存我通过此表单提交的数据。"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:516
msgid "Privacy Policy"
msgstr "隐私政策"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:562
msgid "Error: you must agree with the terms to send a comment. Hit the back button on your web browser and resubmit your comment if you agree with the terms."
msgstr "错误：您必须同意这些条款才能发送评论。如果您同意这些条款，请点击网络浏览器的后退按钮，重新提交您的评论。"

#: templates/cren/notification.php:1
msgid "Hi %s"
msgstr "%s，您好"

#: templates/cren/notification.php:3
msgid "%s has replied to your comment on"
msgstr "%s回复了您的评论"

#: templates/cren/notification.php:9
msgid "Click here to reply"
msgstr "点击这里回复"

#: templates/cren/notification.php:11
msgid "Click here to stop receiving these messages"
msgstr "点击这里停止接收这些消息"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:150
msgid "Check the subscription checkbox by default"
msgstr "默认勾选订阅复选框"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:154
msgid "Display the GDPR checkbox"
msgstr "显示GDPR复选框"

#: classes/CommentReplyEmailNotification.php:158
msgid "Privacy Policy URL"
msgstr "隐私政策网址"